# Copy to .env.local for local development.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ is a prefix with consequences: everything carrying it is inlined
# into the client bundle and is readable by anyone who loads the page. Only put
# values here that are already public. Secrets belong in apps/api/.env, which the
# browser never sees.

# Where the API answers. The guest session is a cookie that API sets on its own
# origin, so this has to match WEB_ORIGIN's counterpart in apps/api/.env — the
# API's CORS allowlist is a single origin, and a mismatch here fails sign-in with
# a CORS error rather than a wrong password.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
